 - 2026-08-24 (outer loop): CORRIGENDUM to the REQ-ARC-WMTE-6710 entry above, from an independent adversarial review of commit 288ea485f9. That commit shipped TWO RED tests and one real bug; its "82 tests pass across the 7 affected suites" line was true of the seven suites chosen and false of the repository — the suite set was narrower than the concept it named, which is this project's own named bug class. (1) `test_experiment_4544_llm_proposer_reinduction.py` asserted the exception path reports `no_reachable_plan_after_refinement`; that assertion pinned the defect REQ-6710 removes, and is updated to `selection_or_planning_exception` with the reason recorded inline. (2) `test_arc_refactor_write_collapse_instrumentation_20260803.py` guards the round-row key set and `channel_chars` was undeclared; added to `_SIBLING_REQ_ROW_KEYS`. (3) REAL BUG: the widening created the mis-attribution in reverse. The no-plan fall-through was the one loop exit that never assigned `skipped`, so an earlier round's dynamics failure survived into an attempt that ended on the planner. Latent at the shipped `MAX_REFINEMENT_ROUNDS=1`, live whenever the cap is raised. Fixed; semantics are now last-round-wins throughout. (4) The loop-side `channels_before` read was decorative — replacing it with `{}` left the suite green. (5) `_round_digest` head-sliced and dropped the LAST round, the one whose cause the attempt reports, recreating this REQ's own failure mode one layer down; now keeps head and tail. (6) The harness `_channel_delta` had no clamp despite SCENARIO-6710-7 requiring one, and could raise after the episode; clamped and made junk-tolerant. (7) The harness read `proposer.channel_totals` defensively at entry and bare at exit; both are defensive now. Four new mutations M8-M11, each RED then restored byte-identical. CORRECTED FIGURE: the "9 of 18 skip records" quoted from the originating brief does not reproduce. Measured over every `induction_skipped` counter under `results/**` on 2026-08-24: the default is 9 of 120 skip records outside the induction-disabled case, 9 of 3034 including it. The numerator reproduces; the denominator does not. Spec, status and test prose corrected.
 - 2026-08-25: Isolated repo-wide suite truth baseline and mutation audit (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_isolated_environment: pytest_receipt; results/experiment_6586_isolated_full_suite_truth_baseline.json
 - 2026-08-25 (outer loop): SECOND CORRIGENDUM to REQ-ARC-WMTE-6710, on team-lead ruling. (1) MUTATION PROOFS RE-RUN FROM SCRATCH AND THE EARLIER SET TREATED AS VOID. Two mutation harnesses had been writing the same three source files in the same checkout with no lock, so a RED reading attributed to one agent's deleted pattern could equally have been the other agent's live mutation. That contamination is symmetric and undetectable by re-reading one's own code. All eleven mutations M1-M11 were re-run in an isolated `git worktree` copy with `PYTHONPATH` pinned to the worktree — verified necessary, because the venv resolves `carnot` to the main checkout, so worktree mutations would otherwise have been silently inert and every reading falsely GREEN. Result: all 11 RED, baseline GREEN at 14 tests, zero `MUTATED` markers in the three files before and after. No earlier reading is carried forward. (2) THE PREVALENCE FIGURE IS WITHDRAWN ENTIRELY, not corrected. `no_reachable_plan_after_refinement` is ALSO the correct label for a genuine no-plan attempt, so that counter can never separate a real planning failure from a masked dynamics failure — no denominator makes it meaningful. Two figures were quoted during this work ("9 of 18" from the brief, "9 of 120" measured); both are withdrawn. The defect is now stated from the code path — the default is assigned before the loop runs, and two sites that diagnosed a cause did not overwrite it — and the per-round record added by this REQ is what makes the prevalence measurable for the first time. (3) `plan_reaches_goal` is deliberately left absent (None) on rounds that skip before planning, with the reasoning recorded at the harness read site: absent means "the planner never ran", False means "it ran and found nothing", and defaulting it to False would rebuild the masking defect inside the instrument meant to expose it. (4) Mutation harnesses must not run in this checkout: the conductor commits `git add -A` with pre-commit verification skipped, on its own schedule, and a mutated line that is still valid Python passes every hook.
+- 2026-08-25: V573 SOTA constraint-first source and method contract (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: source, fixture, router, metric, and exact-authority contracts are ready before any V573 model outcome; results/experiment_6587_v573_constraint_first_method_contract.json
